  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=794422), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8435011)\n\nJoo-young, a reporter on the verge of being fired, tries to land a scoop by resorting to \"trash journalism,\" but it isn't easy. Then, a tabloid accidentally catches her eye... It claims that Stephanie Jin, a top celebrity famous who remains single and childless, is actually a mother! \n\nDesperate for a scoop, Joo-young decides to infiltrate B-Town to uncover Stephanie's secret...! \n\nWhat  is the truth behind this single-mother scandal?",
